# Phase 2 service isolation: load ONLY into the project anchor on Bineet's Mac.
# Current LAN: edge 10.7.31.231; Backend A 10.7.1.112:3001; interface en0.
# Recheck addresses/interface if the LAN changes. These rules cover IPv4.
pass in quick on en0 inet proto tcp from 10.7.31.231 to 10.7.1.112 port 3001 flags S/SA keep state label "cn-a-edge-allow"
block return in quick on en0 inet proto tcp from any to 10.7.1.112 port 3001 label "cn-a-client-block"
